{"id": "555dc73c-340c-45eb-8b89-9ddaf0789b48", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "That source IP resolves to a Transit Gateway attachment ENI (`eni-0123456789abc0002`, account 012345678901_1, subnet `subnet-0123456789abc0001`, VPC `vpc-0123456789abc0001`), not a plain instance — so this traffic transits a TGW and the destination `10.0.2.9` isn't a local ENI in this account. That's a few more hops to check (TGW route tables, peer VPC/account, SGs and NACLs on both ends), so let me dig into that properly rather than guess.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_ZW5LzpPMHDigh0cZJ7SQ6C", "tool_name": "gather_context", "input": {"deep_research": false, "prompt": "{
  "task": "Determine whether a Security Group or a Network ACL caused a single flow-log REJECT, following the network-log-analyzer skill's Step 4 confirmation methodology (read-only describe-* calls only).",
